    "summary": "web: HEAD returns 404 despite Allow: GET, HEAD; config 500 page + stale panel polish",
    "details_md": "(1) Routes register GET only; Bun does not auto-map HEAD, so HEAD /tickets is 404 while the 405 fallback and docs advertise HEAD — health checks report the UI dead (server.ts:96). (2) Stale panel sorts and labels review tickets by last_activity_at instead of review.requested_at (stale.ts:37,45) — under-reports how long an MR has waited.",
